1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Balabat of Mecha, was member of first Ethiopian parliament. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Biological son of Reba, adopted by his uncle Wami, whom he succeeded as balabat.   As a young man, Doyo managed to raise and sell enough livestock to purchase weapons and went off on a life of adventure  in Wellega, Beni Shangul a
2 CONC nd beyond.  He earned his living hunting and trading skins, ivory etc. When Wami died in the influenza pandemic of 1918, Doyo returned to mecha and became balabat.
