1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Talatem of Abyssinia (698-762) was the king of Abyssinia from 741 to 762, succeeding Letem of Abyssinia and preceding Ayzur of Abyssinia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Talatem of Abyssinia was born in 698, the son of King Letem of Abyssinia. He was a Miaphysite Christian of the Solomonic dynasty of Abyssinia, and he reigned as king of Ethiopia from 741 to 762. When he died in 762 at the age of 6
2 CONC 4, he was succeeded by Ayzur of Abyssinia.
2 CONT
