1 CONT ^ Francisco Alvarez, The Prester John of the Indies translated by C.F. Beckingham and G.W.B. Huntingford (Cambridge: Hakluyt Society, 1961), chapter 53. 
1 CONT ^ Taddesse Tamrat, p. 58. 
1 CONT ^ Paul B. Henze, Layers of Time, A History of Ethiopia (New York: Palgrave, 2000), p. 51. 
1 CONT ^ Alvarez, chapter 59. 
